Package: nlcs
Type: Package
Title: Normative Latent Cognitive Structure Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Chen", family = "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "chench61@alumni.nu.ac.th")
Description: Constructs a normative latent cognitive structure (N-LCS) from
    healthy-control cognitive test scores. The package standardizes scores to
    healthy controls, evaluates a one-factor solution with parallel analysis
    and Velicer's MAP, constructs a whitened covariance space, and calculates
    cognitive-dimension magnitude (CDM) and cognitive-deviation angle (CDA).
